#: views/settings-page.php:40
msgid ""
"Caching plugins may interfere with accurate carbon emissions measurements. "
"Please make sure to clear your cache if your settings are not working or you "
"are not seeing any emissions results. Note: if you are using LiteSpeed "
"Cache, you need to clear the cache manually after every measurement for now."
