msgstr "Opslaan van instellingen mislukt. Probeer opnieuw."

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:340
msgid ""
"Thank you for joining us in our quest to make the internet more sustainable. "
"With this plugin, you can calculate and display the carbon footprint of your "
"website in the footprint. Follow these steps to set up your own "
"carbonfooter! "
msgstr ""
"Bedankt dat je meedoet aan onze missie om het internet duurzamer te maken. "
"Met deze plugin kun je de CO₂-voetafdruk van je website berekenen en tonen. "
"Volg deze stappen om je eigen carbonfooter in te stellen!"

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:361
msgid "Step 1 - Design your carbonfooter"
msgstr "Stap 1 – Ontwerp je carbonfooter"

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:382
msgid "Define your style"
msgstr "Bepaal je stijl"

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:384
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Opmaak"

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:393
msgid "Minimal"
msgstr "Minimaal"

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:394
msgid "Minimal: only one line of text showing the CO2 value of the web page."
msgstr "Minimaal: slechts één regel tekst met de CO₂-waarde van de pagina."

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:401
msgid "Full Banner"
msgstr "Volledige banner"

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:402
msgid ""
"Full banner: shows 5 icons and more detailed information on the "
"sustainability of the web page"
msgstr ""
"Volledige banner: toont 5 iconen en meer gedetailleerde informatie over de "
"duurzaamheid van de pagina."

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:409
msgid "Sticker"
msgstr "Sticker"

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:410
msgid ""
"Sticker: compact sticker-style badge perfect to fit into a corner of your "
"web page."
msgstr ""
"Sticker: compacte badge in stickerstijl, perfect om in een hoek van je "
"webpagina te plaatsen."

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:417
msgid "Label"
msgstr ""

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:418
msgid ""
"Label: subtle badge. Shortcode only — use [carbonfooter style=\"label\"] "
"(not available for automatic display)."
msgstr ""

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:429
msgid "Background color"
msgstr "Achtergrondkleur"

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:438
msgid "Text color"
msgstr "Tekstkleur"

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:450
msgid "Live Preview"
msgstr "Live voorbeeld"

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:453
msgid "This is what your carbonfooter will look like:"
msgstr "Zo ziet je carbonfooter eruit:"

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:479
msgid "Save your design"
msgstr "Sla je ontwerp op"

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:487
msgid "Step 2. Show your carbonfooter"
msgstr "Stap 2 – Toon je carbonfooter"

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:504
msgid ""
"You can choose if you want to show your carbonfooter automatically or "
"manually. Don’t know which one to choose? Start with the automatic display, "
"and if that one doesn’t show in the proper place, switch to the manual mode."
msgstr ""
"Je kunt kiezen of je de carbonfooter automatisch of handmatig wilt tonen. "
"Weet je het niet zeker? Begin met automatisch; werkt dat niet goed in je "
"thema, schakel dan over naar handmatig."

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:516
msgid "Display automatically"
msgstr "Automatisch tonen"

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:517
msgid ""
"The carbonfooter will be shown automatically on all pages at the end of your "
"footer. Works fine with most themes."
msgstr ""
"De carbonfooter wordt automatisch op alle pagina’s getoond, onderaan in de "
"footer. Werkt bij de meeste thema’s."

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:524
msgid "Add manually"
msgstr "Handmatig toevoegen"

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:525
msgid ""
"The carbonfooter will be shown after you added the shortcode to your footer "
"(or any other widget or textfield)."
msgstr ""
"De carbonfooter verschijnt nadat je de shortcode in je footer hebt geplaatst "
"(of in een widget of tekstveld)."

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:538
msgid ""
"Copy and paste the shortcode below, including the brackets, to your footer "
"or any widget / textfield. The shortcode will automatically use the layout "
"and colors you’ve configured above."
msgstr ""
"Kopieer en plak de shortcode hieronder, inclusief de haakjes, in je footer "
"of in een widget/tekstveld. De shortcode gebruikt automatisch de opmaak en "
"kleuren die je hierboven hebt ingesteld."

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:562
msgid "Save Display Settings"
msgstr "Sla weergave-instellingen op"

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:570
msgid "Step 3. You're all set!"
msgstr "Stap 3 – Je bent klaar!"

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:577
msgid ""
"Great! Your homepage has already been measured. You can view the results on "
"your homepage."
msgstr ""
"Mooi! Je homepage is al gemeten. Je kunt de resultaten op je homepage "
"bekijken."

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:600
msgid "You can start measuring, showing and reducing your footprint."
msgstr "Je kunt nu beginnen met meten, tonen en verminderen van je voetafdruk."

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:612
msgid "Start measuring now"
msgstr "Begin nu met meten"

#: build/index.js:3 src/views/SettingsPage.js:618
msgid ""
"Besides showing the carbonfooterprint in the footer, you will now see an "
"extra column behind each post and page that shows the carbon emissions "
"generated when someone visits the page."
msgstr ""
"Naast het tonen van de carbonfooter in de footer, zie je nu ook een extra "
"kolom bij elk bericht en elke pagina die de uitstoot per bezoek toont."

